🦊 FOX MESSENGER - Project Summary
====================================

📦 VERSION: 0.1.0
🗓️ CREATED: December 6, 2025
✅ STATUS: Production Ready (UI/UX)

🎯 WHAT'S INCLUDED
==================

1️⃣ COMPONENTS (6)
   ✓ Sidebar - Navigation & User Profile
   ✓ ChatList - Chat Search & Management
   ✓ ChatWindow - Message Display & Input
   ✓ CallModal - WebRTC Video Calls
   ✓ FriendsPanel - Friends Management
   ✓ DeveloperPanel - Debug & Monitoring

2️⃣ PAGES (5)
   ✓ /chats - Main 3-column chat interface
   ✓ /friends - Friends list & management
   ✓ /calls - Call history
   ✓ /settings - Profile & preferences
   ✓ / - Home (redirects to /chats)

3️⃣ API ROUTES (3)
   ✓ /api/debug/report-error - Error tracking
   ✓ /api/webrtc/signal - WebRTC signaling
   ✓ /api/health - Server health check

4️⃣ DOCUMENTATION (7 files)
   ✓ README.md - Project overview
   ✓ QUICK_START.md - 5-minute setup
   ✓ ARCHITECTURE.md - System design
   ✓ DESIGN.md - UI/UX specifications
   ✓ DEPLOYMENT.md - Vercel deployment
   ✓ PROJECT_MANIFEST.md - Full project details
   ✓ SUMMARY.md - Quick reference

🎨 DESIGN
=========
Colors:     Orange (#FF6700) on Black (#000000, #121212)
Layout:     3-column desktop (256px | 320px | flex)
Typography: Modern, minimalist
Responsive: Supports tablets & laptops

🔧 TECH STACK
==============
Frontend:   Next.js 16.0.7, React 19.2.0, TypeScript 5
UI:         Tailwind CSS 4, Lucide React icons
State:      Zustand 4.4.0
Realtime:   WebSocket, WebRTC (Simple-peer)
Hosting:    Vercel (SSR/SSG + Edge Functions)

🚀 QUICK START
===============
1. npm install --legacy-peer-deps
2. npm run dev
3. Open http://localhost:3000

